{"row": 1090, "printed_title": "Cambaguio CIS: Replacement of Damage Pipes & Desilting of Dam", "revised_title": "Dumaguete-Sibulan CIS: Repair of Right Main Canal (Sta.  0+000 - 0+052)", "revised_amount": 700000, "justification": "Cambaguio CIS is proposed to be replaced with Dumaguete-Sibulan CIS because the Barangay Captain of Cambaguio, Bais City prefers to change the project scope from pipeline replacement to canal lining, which is not covered by the existing project design and budget.  

