16°42'36.2"N 121°37'45.4"E", "revised_amount": 50000000, "justification": "During the construction of the Licaray Pump Irrigation System (PIS), it was established that the project site was originally identified as being within the territorial jurisdiction of Barangay Quezon. Where Licaray Creek serves as the natural boundary between the two neighboring barangays, namely Barangay Quezon and Barangay Doña Paulina.

